[OC]Into the big building at the south end of Moonbrook and down the mine tunnels
[OC]|cffffcc00You tank the run:|r Defensive Stance and the shield throughout. Thunder Clap to open packs (usable in Defensive Stance on Forever - unverified), Sunder the kill target, Revenge on cooldown, Taunt whatever peels; Shield Block on the hard hitters (Rhahk'Zor, Mr. Smite, VanCleef). Pull Defias casters around a corner so they come to you
