[OC]|cffffffffBoss 2 - Sneed's Shredder, then Sneed|r (20) at the top of the wooden ramps
[OC]Kill the shredder; Sneed jumps out and fights on foot. Loot the Gnoam Sprecklesprocket from the shredder
[OC]|cffffcc00Tank:|r hold the Shredder where it stands, then Taunt Sneed the moment he jumps out
