[OC][A Warrior] |cffffcc00Loot (Sneed's Shredder):|r roll on |cff66ff66Buzz Saw|r (1H sword 15.2 dps +3 Agi +3 Sta, 11.03% drop); |cff66ff66Buzzer Blade|r (dagger 9.0 dps, 49.98% drop); |cff66ff66Dull Sawblade|r (thrown 12.7 dps +2 Sta +6 AP, 1.82% drop)
[OC][A Warrior] |cffffcc00Loot (Sneed):|r roll on |cff66ff66Bandsaw Wristbands|r (mail wrist +5 Sta, 0.95% drop)
