[OC][A Warrior] |cffffcc00Loot (Gilnid):|r roll on |cff66ff66Goblin Hammer|r (1H mace 15.2 dps +4 Sta, 1.30% drop); |cff66ff66Smelting Pants|r (leather legs +7 Sta, 55.26% drop); |cff66ff66Lavishly Jeweled Ring|r (ring +2 Agi, 37.47% drop)
