[OC]|cffffffffBoss 4 - Mr. Smite|r (20) on the ship deck
[OC]At 66% and 33% he stuns everyone and runs to his chest to swap weapons - Shield Block his swings, Taunt him back the moment he returns and keep him facing away from the group; he hits hardest with the 2H
